@title: A payment form in a cross-site frame
# Chrome runs the frame in a process of its own (an OOPIF); Firefox does not
# deliver a top-level click into it. Both are reached.
STEP 1: Fill and submit inside the frame
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/pay.html
    VERIFY that 'Card not checked' is present
    FILL 'Card number' field with '4242 4242'
    VERIFY 'Card number' field has value '4242 4242'
    PRESS ENTER
    VERIFY that 'Card checked: 4242 4242' is present
STEP 2: A click inside it reaches the page through postMessage
    CLICK the 'Pay now' button
    VERIFY that 'paid with 4242 4242' is present
STEP 3: A frame inside the cross-site frame
    CLICK the 'Card help' button
    VERIFY that 'help opened' is present
DONE.
